WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.062
In under two minutes, you will review the homes your neighbors entered.

00:00:04.062 --> 00:00:05.079
We start on the map.

00:00:05.979 --> 00:00:09.265
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.543 --> 00:00:13.974
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:13.974 --> 00:00:16.473
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:16.473 --> 00:00:17.824
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.681 --> 00:00:22.050
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:22.747
Tap Allow.

00:00:26.623 --> 00:00:28.990
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:30.144
See the three dots?

00:00:30.144 --> 00:00:30.663
Tap them.

00:00:32.689 --> 00:00:34.581
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:36.462 --> 00:00:37.060
Tap Mine.

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:38.912
These are the contests you run.

00:00:40.612 --> 00:00:42.516
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:42.516 --> 00:00:43.805
This is your dashboard.

00:00:45.706 --> 00:00:46.502
Tap Entries.

00:00:46.502 --> 00:00:49.259
Nothing goes on the map until you approve it.

00:00:51.075 --> 00:00:54.070
Tap Approve to put a home in the contest, and on the map.

00:00:55.967 --> 00:00:58.277
Tap Decline if an entry does not fit.

00:01:00.038 --> 00:01:01.244
A window asks why.

00:01:01.244 --> 00:01:04.922
The reason is optional, and it is emailed to the entrant.

00:01:04.922 --> 00:01:06.064
Tap Decline entry.

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:09.753
Changed your mind?

00:01:09.753 --> 00:01:11.321
Tap Restore to put it back.

00:01:13.213 --> 00:01:16.395
Next up: Edit your contest and change the dates.
